{"hymn":"S607","parent":"E785","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Expresadlo en oración","subtitle":"Oración—Expresar al Señor","syl":{"n1":["Ex","i"],"n2":["pre","m"],"n3":["sad","m"],"n4":["lo‿en","t"],"n5":["o","i"],"n6":["ra","m"],"n7":["ción,","t"],"n8":"No","n9":"a","n10":["nues","i"],"n11":["tro","t"],"n12":["pro","i"],"n13":["pio","t"],"n14":"yo;","n15":"Que","n16":"nos","n17":["mues","i"],"n18":["tre","t"],"n19":"el","n20":["Se","i"],"n21":["ñor","t"],"n22":"Su","n23":["de","i"],"n24":["se","m"],"n25":["o‿en","t"],"n26":["lo‿in","i"],"n27":["te","m"],"n28":["rior.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Expresadlo‿en oración;","Su intención hay que exponer;","Nuestra mente hay que acallar","Para Su mente tener."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Expresadlo‿en oración,","Siempre contemplándolo;","Cual espejo, reflejad","Todo Su glorioso ser."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Expresadlo‿en oración;","En nosotros ruegue Él;","Que al Cristo celestial","Ore el Cristo en nuestro ser."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Expresadlo‿en oración;","Nunca oremos en el yo.","Totalmente orando en Él,","Oremos con el Señor."]}]}